speechtext:
The Department of Justice does not maintain names and addresses of lawyers who have acted as legal agents by reference to electoral boundaries; nor does it maintain a list of lawyers retained for future work since lawyers are not so retained. The names and addresses of all lawyers who appear in the records of the Department of Justice as having performed legal services on behalf of the Minister of Justice in the province of Prince Edward Island for the period April 1, 1972 to March 31, 1973 are set forth in the following list;
[Mr. Marchand (Langelier).J
Bell, Morley, Summerside; Ghiz, J. A., Charlottetown; Large, Frederick A., Charlottetown; MacDonald G. Bruce, Summerside; MacDonald, Kennedy R., Montague; MacCl-eod, Summerside; McMahon George R., Summerside; Mull-aly, George J., Charlottetown; O'Donnell Lester, Charlottetown; Sigsworth, D.F., Charlottetown; Tweedy, G. G., Charlottetown.
